---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Jack Yu - Portfolio" description="Portfolio of Jack Yu">
  <div class="content-wrapper">
    <section class="block section-panel about" id="about">
      <h2>About Me</h2>
      <img
        src="/images/headshotcompressed.jpg"
        alt="Jack Yu headshot"
        class="image headshot"
        width="180"
        height="180"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="sync"
        fetchpriority="high"
        style="background-color:#f4f4f4;filter: grayscale(0.6) brightness(1.1) contrast(0.9);"
      />

      <p>
        I am a sophomore at Caltech majoring in physics. I am interested in
        developing the robust instrumentation and techniques required for
        quantum sensing, quantum computing, solid-state electrolytes, nuclear
        fusion, among many other emerging technological paradigms. So far, I
        have worked in Caltech's
        <a href="https://caltechexperimentalgravity.github.io/"
          >Experimental Gravity Group</a
        >, where I simulate quantum states useful for real-world quantum
        computing, and in the <a href="https://cushinglab.caltech.edu/"
          >Cushing Lab</a
        >, where I develop spectroscopic instrumentation and techniques to study
        how ions interact and move in solid-state electrolytes. Before Caltech,
        I spent two summers working with VCSELs in an optoelectronics R&D lab at
        Sandia National Labs.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside the lab, I compete on Caltech's NCAA swim team and enjoy
        photography, printmaking, and reading science fiction.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
